title: '[[id:264b015f-bc37-4c8f-923c-503bb02e3f18][A dream replays the new among the old: it harms where it overwrites, and a new note settles fastest where the graph already has a place for it.]]'
pid: 3af89bda-be73-4550-a6cc-5e73ed25b382
body: |2-
  Two findings about sleeping brains, read as analogies for tending
  and dreaming; for Gen to weigh.
